msgid "`\"12.50\".isdigit()` and `\"-5\".isdigit()` are `False`: a point and a minus are not digits. Use [`isdigit`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str.isdigit) for ids and codes. For numbers, convert with [`float()`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#float) (section 6)."
